OL,3,AApple unsure when more foldable iPhones
OL,4,Awill be available after selling out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe phones are still in high demand and
OL,7,FSabhi Kahn, Apple's new chief operating
OL,8,Fofficer, said the technology giant did
OL,9,Fnot know when more Duos would be
OL,10,Favailable.
